      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1 style=\\\"text-align: center\\\">Stable Audio Prompts</h1><p>\\n</p><p style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"><b>Each prompt is in its own copyable code block.</b></p><p>\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-thick\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Cinematic Orchestra</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Emotional cinematic piano and strings with slow chord movement, intimate cello melody, soft room tone, bittersweet atmosphere.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Suspense thriller underscore with pulsing low strings, ticking percussion, muted piano hits, unresolved harmonic tension.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Magical discovery cue with harp, celesta, soft flutes, shimmering strings, gentle wonder, warm fairytale atmosphere.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Electronic Music</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Dark techno groove with saturated kick, modular bass sequence, metallic percussion, warehouse reverb, relentless energy.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Synthwave night-drive instrumental with analog bass, gated drums, glassy lead synth, neon city atmosphere.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Retro arcade electro with chiptune leads, punchy drums, playful synth bass, bright game-like energy.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Hip Hop and Beats</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Lo-fi hip hop beat with mellow piano, soft drums, tape hiss, warm bass, rainy-window mood.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>West Coast hip hop beat with funky bass, talkbox-style synth lead, crisp clap, sunny boulevard energy.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Soulful R&amp;B beat with smooth electric piano, soft snare, deep bass, gentle melodic hooks.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Rock and Guitar</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Heavy metal riff with distorted guitars, double-kick drums, aggressive bass, dark minor-key energy.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Desert rock groove with fuzzy guitars, dry drums, heavy bass, wide open-road atmosphere.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Punk rock instrumental with fast drums, raw guitars, energetic bass, short aggressive structure.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Jazz and Blues</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Jazz trio with piano, upright bass, ride cymbal, smoky club ambience, tasteful improvisational phrasing.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Lounge jazz with vibraphone, soft piano, brushed snare, upright bass, relaxed cocktail atmosphere.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Smooth jazz instrumental with clean guitar, electric piano, soft saxophone, polished evening mood.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Isolated Instruments</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Delicate solo nylon-string acoustic guitar fingerpicking, intimate body resonance, subtle room tone, warm close-mic sound.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Upright bass pizzicato line with woody attack, finger noise, jazz room ambience, warm natural tone.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Tribal African drums solo, isolated.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Environmental Ambience</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Tropical rainforest dawn with layered insects, distant birds, faint wet foliage movement.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Spaceship engine room with low reactor hum, servo ticks, air circulation, distant metallic resonance.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Subway platform ambience with distant train rumble, PA texture, footsteps, urban reverb.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Foley Sounds</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Footsteps on gravel at medium pace, alternating left-right detail, outdoor realism.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Pencil scribbling on textured paper, natural pressure variation, close desk sound.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Backpack zipper opening with fabric movement, metal pull detail, close realistic recording.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Impacts and Hits</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Low cinematic boom hit with dense sub weight, soft noisy tail, modern trailer sound design.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Trailer-style drum hit with taiko body, metal layer, huge reverb tail, dramatic emphasis.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Short punch impact with tight low end, skin slap detail, dry action-scene realism.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>UI and App Sounds</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Clean UI select click with modern glass-like transient, tiny tonal tail, premium software feel.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Minimal phone notification sound with clear attack, soft decay, modern friendly tone.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Payment success sound with elegant two-note chime, soft shimmer, premium checkout confirmation.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Game Audio</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Treasure chest opening with wooden creak, metal latch, gold sparkle, satisfying reveal.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Sword swing heavy attack with broad air displacement, metal resonance, aggressive low whoosh.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Zombie groan with dry throat rasp, slow breath, unsettling human-like decay.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Sci-Fi Sound Design</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Spaceship door opening with hydraulic hiss, servo motors, metal panel slide, pressurized air release.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Robot head movement with tiny servos.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Space station alarm with pulsing siren, warning tones, distant PA distortion, emergency atmosphere.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Mechanical and Industrial</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Clockwork mechanism loop with tiny gears, spring tension, precise repeated motion, metallic detail.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Old elevator start and stop with cable tension, motor hum, relay clicks, building resonance.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Rusty chain pulley movement with metal strain, creaks, heavy suspended load.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Vehicles</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Diesel truck engine idle with low vibration, mechanical clatter, distant exhaust texture.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Helicopter flyover with rotor blade slap, Doppler movement, heavy air pressure.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Old boat engine chugging on calm water, motor sputter, small wave movement.</code></pre><p>\\n\\n</p><h2>Animal Sounds</h2><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Wolf howl at night with distant forest echo, cold air, lonely sustained tone, natural outdoor ambience.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Cat meow with soft vocal tone, close domestic room sound, gentle curious expression.</code></pre><p>\\n</p><pre><code>Owl hoot at night with soft forest echo, cold air, quiet nocturnal ambience.</code></pre>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#f66744\",\"lineColor\":\"#f66744\",\"width\":523.4343023813685,\"height\":488.56950858178766,\"backgroundColor\":\"#2a2a2a\"}",
